            "type": "text",
            "category": "Other",
            "object_relation": "notes",
            "value": "Trust Acceptance Event: SolarWinds Orion update v2019.4-2020.2.1 containing SUNBURST backdoor accepted and installed by target organization via legitimate update channel. The compromised DLL (SolarWinds.Orion.Core.BusinessLayer.dll) was digitally signed by SolarWinds, passing all trust verification. Falsifiability test: removing the third-party trust link (not accepting the update) would have prevented this step.",
