          {
            "type": "text",
            "category": "Other",
            "object_relation": "notes",
            "value": "FEC execution via designed capability: SUNBURST backdoor DLL loaded and executed by the legitimate SolarWinds Orion service (solarwinds.businesslayerhost.exe). The execution used the environment's intended DLL loading mechanism — an intended data→code transition, not an exploit. SUNBURST remained dormant for approximately 12-14 days before activating C2 communication via DNS (avsvmcloud.com). R-EXEC satisfied: FEC execution recorded as #7.",
            "uuid": "25408dd3-b725-5aaf-8fea-48f0224a0373",
            "timestamp": "1771804800",
