          {
            "type": "text",
            "category": "Other",
            "object_relation": "notes",
            "value": "Credential application: attacker forged SAML tokens using stolen signing certificates to impersonate legitimate users and access cloud resources (Azure AD, Office 365). Per Axiom X: the acquisition of the signing key occurred during the #7 step (a consequence of the malware's access, recorded as DRE:C); the USE of forged credentials to authenticate is always #4 regardless of acquisition method.",
