            "object_relation": "notes",
            "value": "Abuse of legitimate cloud functions: attacker used valid (forged) credentials to abuse Azure AD APIs, Office 365 mail reading APIs, and federated trust configurations for data exfiltration. No code flaw exploited — the attacker operated within the designed functionality of the cloud platform using stolen identity. Data stayed data; no foreign code was introduced at this stage.",
